  'operation' => 'newTopic',
  'SessionId' => '500ed5974be5b479d952e64e8de10ae4',
  'forumId' => '14',
  'title' => 'Planning my DW and need some destination suggestions! ',
  'postContent' => 'Hi! 

Just came across this app and I\'m hoping all of you wonderful people can help me out? 

We\'ve been engaged for a few years but never got round to getting married due to having children etc However, we have now decided on a destination wedding. We are looking to get married in 2017 which I know seems a long time off but we\'ll be able to book up in May 2016. 

It\'s always been a dream of ours to go to the Caribbean so we are looking at Dominican Republic as a possibility. I really like the look of Dreams La Romana. After looking into the cost of the paper work etc it\'s looking like it\'s going to be a bit too expensive. Especially as we will only be able to go during the summer school holidays. 

I am now considering other destinations such as Greece, Mexico, Italy etc

Our ideal destination would be:
• All inclusive
• Cater for children of all ages
• 4 or 5 star hotel
• Opportunity to explore local area
• Scuba diving, paragliding
• Beach wedding location
• soft sand beach
• Family rooms that sleep upto 5

Reasonable price, Beaches is far too expensive! 

All information, suggestions and ideas greatly appreciated. 

Kind regards
MrsM2be :-) 

',
  'follow' => 'False',
  'sessionId' => '500ed5974be5b479d952e64e8de10ae4',
)
