> Time: 1439996163 / Wed, 19 Aug 2015 14:56:03 +0000
> URL: /index.php?/REST/Forums/topic/getPosts?topicId=79010&start=10&SessionId=944a745390f22a03d3c8b77e367d7b7e
> User littlemiss782 (284480)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79010,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2e6a579426989befd55c974063e9e97c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"jessiker05\" post=\"1900092\" timestamp=\"1436459189\"]\nI&#039;ve been looking at this website, wondering if they&#039;re a reliable company. Are you shipping to the US or Canada (or other)? I&#039;m concerned about shipping to Canada... Please post back when you receive them and let us know how everything turned out!  :)[\/quote]\nHey there! It literally took only 5 days to get to my house, and I live in the Northwest Territories, so that&#039;s a far way to travel, haha.  Everything turned out great, I love how everything looks in person. The pants fit a little bigger than they say, but it&#039;s an easy enough fix.  Very decent prices; but we had to pay $60 in custom charges. I figure it&#039;s worth it, because we have absolutely no where to shop here.   I would highly recommend them.","Attachments":[],"Id":1900098,"PostDate":1436464607,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>jessiker05, on 09 July 2015 - 09:26 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I've been looking at this website, wondering if they're a reliable company. Are you shipping to the US or Canada (or other)? I'm concerned about shipping to Canada... Please post back when you receive them and let us know how everything turned out!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hey there! It literally took only 5 days to get to my house, and I live in the Northwest Territories, so that's a far way to travel, haha.\u00a0 Everything turned out great, I love how everything looks in person. The pants fit a little bigger than they say, but it's an easy enough fix.\u00a0 Very decent prices; but we had to pay $60 in custom charges. I figure it's worth it, because we have absolutely no where to shop here.\u00a0\u00a0 I would highly recommend them.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katie_mcbride48@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424117850,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282132.jpg?_r=1437519508","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"KatieMcBride","Id":282132,"Name":"KatieMcBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.222.45.206","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79010,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"da74ed4839fdb3d330176bbe3400f127","RawContent":"[quote name=\"KatieMcBride\" post=\"1900098\" timestamp=\"1436461007\"]\nHey there! It literally took only 5 days to get to my house, and I live in the Northwest Territories, so that&#039;s a far way to travel, haha.  Everything turned out great, I love how everything looks in person. The pants fit a little bigger than they say, but it&#039;s an easy enough fix.  Very decent prices; but we had to pay $60 in custom charges. I figure it&#039;s worth it, because we have absolutely no where to shop here.   I would highly recommend them.[\/quote]Oh that&#039;s great! How do you pay the customs? Upfront when you make the purchase online? And do you have any idea if the amount you pay for customs goes up if you have a bigger order, or is it like a set rate for anything? Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":1900102,"PostDate":1436465351,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>KatieMcBride, on 09 July 2015 - 09:56 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hey there! It literally took only 5 days to get to my house, and I live in the Northwest Territories, so that's a far way to travel, haha.\u00a0 Everything turned out great, I love how everything looks in person. The pants fit a little bigger than they say, but it's an easy enough fix.\u00a0 Very decent prices; but we had to pay $60 in custom charges. I figure it's worth it, because we have absolutely no where to shop here.\u00a0\u00a0 I would highly recommend them.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Oh that's great! How do you pay the customs? Upfront when you make the purchase online? And do you have any idea if the amount you pay for customs goes up if you have a bigger order, or is it like a set rate for anything? Thanks!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#800080;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;\">Jessica<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/span>","Email":"jessiker05@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.222.45.206","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410546713,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279800.jpg?_r=1432039880","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":164,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jessiker05","Id":279800,"Name":"jessiker05","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79010,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1436470345,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7e8ae3083f4e00f3c55bd40552c2daa4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I had to pay the customs charge when I picked it up at Purolator; they just charged it to my credit card. And I THINK the bigger the order, the more you have to pay, but I honestly don&#039;t know how it works.&amp;nbsp; Would be nice if it was just one flat rate!\n\n\nI have a few pictures of what I ordered too if you&#039;re interested in seeing them - let me know :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900115,"PostDate":1436470332,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I had to pay the customs charge when I picked it up at Purolator; they just charged it to my credit card. And I THINK the bigger the order, the more you have to pay, but I honestly don't know how it works.\u00a0 Would be nice if it was just one flat rate!<br><br>\nI have a few pictures of what I ordered too if you're interested in seeing them - let me know <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katie_mcbride48@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424117850,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282132.jpg?_r=1437519508","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"KatieMcBride","Id":282132,"Name":"KatieMcBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.222.45.206","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79010,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e7576d620e312531e355e8b08a881aec","RawContent":"[quote name=\"KatieMcBride\" post=\"1900115\" timestamp=\"1436466732\"]\nI had to pay the customs charge when I picked it up at Purolator; they just charged it to my credit card. And I THINK the bigger the order, the more you have to pay, but I honestly don&#039;t know how it works.  Would be nice if it was just one flat rate!\n\nI have a few pictures of what I ordered too if you&#039;re interested in seeing them - let me know :)[\/quote]\nSure, I&#039;d love to see some pictures! Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":1900443,"PostDate":1436902840,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>KatieMcBride, on 09 July 2015 - 11:32 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I had to pay the customs charge when I picked it up at Purolator; they just charged it to my credit card. And I THINK the bigger the order, the more you have to pay, but I honestly don't know how it works.\u00a0 Would be nice if it was just one flat rate!<br><br>\nI have a few pictures of what I ordered too if you're interested in seeing them - let me know <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Sure, I'd love to see some pictures! Thanks!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#800080;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;\">Jessica<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/span>","Email":"jessiker05@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.222.45.206","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410546713,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279800.jpg?_r=1432039880","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":164,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jessiker05","Id":279800,"Name":"jessiker05","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79010,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"550b5b84eb813b6c5e82de27a225210e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;Ok well that clearly didn&#039;t work, haha! I don&#039;t know how to attach pictures??! I&#039;ll figure it out haha&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900450,"PostDate":1436903817,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><\/p>\n<br \/><p>Ok well that clearly didn't work, haha! I don't know how to attach pictures??! I'll figure it out haha<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katie_mcbride48@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424117850,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282132.jpg?_r=1437519508","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"KatieMcBride","Id":282132,"Name":"KatieMcBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.222.45.206","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79010,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e1fa37744d9a80cbf5b77afb090efe0d","RawContent":"[quote name=\"KatieMcBride\" post=\"1900450\" timestamp=\"1436900217\"]\n\nOk well that clearly didn&#039;t work, haha! I don&#039;t know how to attach pictures??! I&#039;ll figure it out haha\n[\/quote]Lol, go to \"more reply options\" next to the \"post\" button. The option to attached files is in there..","Attachments":[],"Id":1900488,"PostDate":1436965436,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>KatieMcBride, on 14 July 2015 - 11:56 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ok well that clearly didn't work, haha! I don't know how to attach pictures??! I'll figure it out haha<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Lol, go to \"more reply options\" next to the \"post\" button. The option to attached files is in there..<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#800080;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;\">Jessica<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/span>","Email":"jessiker05@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.222.45.206","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410546713,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279800.jpg?_r=1432039880","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":164,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jessiker05","Id":279800,"Name":"jessiker05","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79010,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"46870357eb699649341dc2960eec36e7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Genius!! haha! thank you :)\n\n\nI picked coral for him to wear so he could match the bridal party (colors are coral and mint).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The sizing for the pants definitely runs big if you decide to order from them. But it&#039;s an easy fix :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900539,"PostDate":1436999376,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Genius!! haha! thank you <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\nI picked coral for him to wear so he could match the bridal party (colors are coral and mint).<\/p>\n<p>The sizing for the pants definitely runs big if you decide to order from them. But it's an easy fix <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1900539]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-282132-0-59249200-1436995723.jpg\" title=\"FullSizeRender.jpg -  99.12KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-282132-0-59249200-1436995723.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"FullSizeRender.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1900539]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-282132-0-05828500-1436995732.jpg\" title=\"IMG_0837.JPG -  74.07KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-282132-0-05828500-1436995732.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"IMG_0837.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katie_mcbride48@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424117850,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282132.jpg?_r=1437519508","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"KatieMcBride","Id":282132,"Name":"KatieMcBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.222.45.206","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79010,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"42d398c8a396c1f4d96d61bf270f07f7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"KatieMcBride\"] Thanks for sharing! I just realized I seen these pics in the other thread, lol. Did they tell you what the customs would be in the total price before you placed your order, or was it more of a surprise when you went to pick it up?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900565,"PostDate":1437051307,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282132\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282132-katiemcbride\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">KatieMcBride<\/span><\/a> Thanks for sharing! I just realized I seen these pics in the other thread, lol. Did they tell you what the customs would be in the total price before you placed your order, or was it more of a surprise when you went to pick it up?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#800080;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;\">Jessica<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/span>","Email":"jessiker05@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.222.45.206","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410546713,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279800.jpg?_r=1432039880","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":164,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jessiker05","Id":279800,"Name":"jessiker05","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79010,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ee5d0c6391600cd63b72d55eafecc71c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Somehow I figured out how to post pictures at one point, and then couldn&#039;t the second time - thanks for your help! lol.&amp;nbsp; I did not know what the custom fees would be, I only found out when picking the package up. However, that being said, given where I live (Yellowknife), the fees you&#039;ll have to pay will likely be cheaper since I doubt you&#039;re as far north as I am! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900576,"PostDate":1437064753,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Somehow I figured out how to post pictures at one point, and then couldn't the second time - thanks for your help! lol.\u00a0 I did not know what the custom fees would be, I only found out when picking the package up. However, that being said, given where I live (Yellowknife), the fees you'll have to pay will likely be cheaper since I doubt you're as far north as I am! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katie_mcbride48@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424117850,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282132.jpg?_r=1437519508","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"KatieMcBride","Id":282132,"Name":"KatieMcBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79010,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5fd08c5b90a6b78378d4d4035639ef3a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Custom fees always make me wonder. &amp;nbsp; Honestly, I&#039;ve ordered a lot online over the years and I only paid custom fees once. I always wonder why some so and some don&#039;t?? Maybe the way they label the packaging I guess.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900583,"PostDate":1437068530,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Custom fees always make me wonder. \u00a0 Honestly, I've ordered a lot online over the years and I only paid custom fees once. I always wonder why some so and some don't?? Maybe the way they label the packaging I guess.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399432202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":24,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
