&gt;That is a great rule. thanks&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1798285,"PostDate":1378600581,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>That is a great rule. thanks\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tracynichols@sbcglobal.net","IpAddress":"99.89.189.10","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1264844841,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225165.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"traylynn","Id":225165,"Name":"traylynn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74930,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cd68290b628ef2518fe3564bc6b328fe","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;You are welcome my friends. It works quick and it is easy to remember and it is almost exactly right! Unless of course you are Mariah Carey or something like that and then she may do 90% on diamonds and decorations and 10% on food HAHA. I love to help so if you have any questions feel free to chat me up. Even if you do not get married in our garden in Vallarta if I can give you advice I will be glad to do so;&amp;nbsp;I may be able to help... a destination wedding is similar no matter what beach it is on :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Gracias!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":17991