expensive! \n\n\nAll information, suggestions and ideas greatly appreciated. \n\n\nKind regards\n\nMrsM2be :-)","Attachments":[],"Id":1902835,"PostDate":1439989680,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi! <br><br>\nJust came across this app and I'm hoping all of you wonderful people can help me out? <br><br>\nWe've been engaged for a few years but never got round to getting married due to having children etc However, we have now decided on a destination wedding. We are looking to get married in 2017 which I know seems a long time off but we'll be able to book up in May 2016. <br><br>\nIt's always been a dream of ours to go to the Caribbean so we are looking at Dominican Republic as a possibility. I really like the look of Dreams La Romana. After looking into the cost of the paper work etc it's looking like it's going to be a bit too expensive. Especially as we will only be able to go during the summer school holidays. <br><br>\nI am now considering other destinations such as Greece, Mexico, Italy etc<br><br>\nOur ideal destination would be:<br>\n\u2022 All inclusive<br>\n\u2022 Cater for children of all ages<br>\n\u2022 4 or 5 star hotel<br>\n\u2022 Opportunity to explore local area<br>\n\u2022 Scuba diving, paragliding<br>\n\u2022 Beach wedding location<br>\n\u2022 soft sand beach<br>\n\u2022 Family rooms that sleep upto 5<br><br>\nReasonable price, Beaches is far too expensive! <br><br>\nAll information, suggestions and ideas greatly appreciated. <br><br>\nKind regards<br>\nMrsM2be :-)\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ecushion@hotmail.co.uk","IpAddress":"176.249.218.33","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1439988724,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"littlemiss782","Id":284480,"Name":"littlemiss782","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.17.41.18","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79501,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b6098d30afbdc70919910efd1157562d","RawContent":"First of all congrats!!!  I&#039;m actually getting married at Dreams La Romana July 2016.  Still waiting on a confirmation of date.   I found the price to be not much more than other all inclusive resorts we&#039;ve stayed at.  Depending on where you are coming from will determine airfare price a lot.   However I would suggest Cozumel or the Riveria Maya (playa del Carmen).  I&#039;ve been to both for scuba diving.  - Cozumel is a bit cheaper \n\nGood Luck!! \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1902837,"PostDate":1439990479,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                First of all congrats!!!  I'm actually getting married at Dreams La Romana July 2016.  Still waiting on a confirmation of date.   I found the price to be not much more than other all inclusive resorts we've stayed at.  Depending 